<!-- Six top level entries. The live menu has nine, including one that
     duplicates another and one that is a form rather than a destination.

     "Solutions" and "Services" are deliberately different axes: solutions are
     named after the buyer's situation, services after what we do. A reader who
     knows their problem but not the vocabulary finds themselves in the first
     one. The last entry is the high commitment call to action, so it is a link
     rather than a dropdown. -->
